### Works with the "REST Client" VS Code extension (humao.rest-client)

### 1. Get all
GET http://localhost:3000/api/students

### 2. Create (201)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/students
Content-Type: application/json

{ "rollNumber": "IT2404", "name": "Meera Gupta", "branch": "IT", "semester": 3, "email": "meera@example.com" }

### 2b. Create - invalid body (400)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/students
Content-Type: application/json

{ "rollNumber": "", "name": "X", "semester": "three", "email": "bad" }

### 3. Get by id
GET http://localhost:3000/api/students/201

### 3b. Get by invalid id (404)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/students/999

### 4. Update
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/students/201
Content-Type: application/json

{ "rollNumber": "CSE2401", "name": "Aarav Sharma", "branch": "CSE", "semester": 4, "email": "aarav.sharma@example.com" }

### 5. Delete
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/students/203

### 6. Filter by branch (case-insensitive)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/students/filter?branch=cse

### 6b. Filter - no match (200, [])
GET http://localhost:3000/api/students/filter?branch=MECH
